WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.440
Hey, I’m Brian Kennedy

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:01.840
Junior.

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:03.520
Welcome to The Ballers

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:03.920
Kingdom.

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:05.520
Getting better takes

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:06.560
more than showing up.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:07.840
It takes purpose,

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:09.520
consistent work, and

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.560
someone who sees what

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:11.360
you’re capable of.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:12.560
That’s what we’re here

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:13.920
for—to challenge you,

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.440
support you, and help

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:16.560
you take the next step.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.080
Dedicated to training

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.200
and development at the

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:19.920
highest level.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:21.120
Let’s get to work.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:22.640
Visit ball kingdom dot

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.040
com.
